{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（9日）下午1時許，警方接獲深水埗青山道128號威利商業大廈一名保安員報案，指大廈有一扇鋁窗搖搖欲墜，恐有墮下危險。警方到場隨即圍封大廈對開一段行人路以策安全。現場可見，大廈一扇鋁窗幾乎懸在半空，隨時有飛墮街頭之虞，險象環生。</p><figure><img alt=\"大廈一扇鋁窗幾乎懸在半空。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261109/1196465422640484352207896.jpeg/d8xHUwn1RKPdAYwAMxhq8dZ4xnAsCb4tIcHR8yHB0fM\"/><figcaption>大廈一扇鋁窗幾乎懸在半空。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"大廈一扇鋁窗幾乎懸在半空。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261109/1196465420564172800102359.jpeg/v6gW9rkpjwhLWj2FuyELrEUPVw_bPfYt5dXTc-XV03M\"/><figcaption>大廈一扇鋁窗幾乎懸在半空。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員圍封現場以策安全。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261109/1196465418223620096327645.jpeg/J8atSl7T6wDOHEyQwbFf53WXoSiz1n3IEh2fBxIdnwc\"/><figcaption>警員圍封現場以策安全。</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員圍封現場以策安全。\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261109/1196465415690129408812543.jpeg/N1fJ4geONaUarRuyfdsFdKKBGSzWcIcNvKMlkryjJZI\"/><figcaption>警員圍封現場以策安全。</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.200094+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":167,"images":4,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T07:13:03+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:32.851200+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:32.851200+00:00","content_hash":"ebc506541902cbb65a2280bdb51bcb61e841a1a198e6940a8dce425784dc04c0","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}